‚␀­–Ÿ-œJLJyQ™ìŠËk`Q¼Mmü°İjÇ&5ØÀo „é”±›…Ã[ÛJèÈøvÙSuper Pi Mod!

This is a modified version of Super Pi which shows milliseconds.
Work in progress, I'm going to try to add it in the highscore list as well.

To do this mod I used IDA, RTA, UltraEdit, Hiew and calc.exe :)

Latest version will always be at http://www.radeonx.com/super_pi_mod.zip
Unless the server goes down or someone steals the domain of course.

-- n111co@hotmail.com



Changelog:
2005/02/21: first version
2005/02/21: fixed minute bug (1:20 would show as 1:80)
2005/02/22: super pi mod now loads/saves the result times in msecs in pi_rec.dat
            the original pi_rec.txt is no longer used in this version because it
            just wasn't worth the trouble. super pi originally stores the results
            in seconds internally so I had to do quite a bit of editing to get
            this to work at all :)

